<title>UK: TABLE-Dixons profits soar in year.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Dixons profits soar in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>53 weeks to May 3, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		29.4		   vs 22.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 8.10		   vs 6.70</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 10.50		  vs 8.75</p>
<p> Pretax preexcept	 190.2		  vs 135.2</p>
<p> Pretax		     200.2		  vs 101.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   2.42 bln	     vs 2.42 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 180.0 and 196.5 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Dixons Group Plc Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
